nd records to a Matomo installation as events, through its bulk tracking API.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/matomoencoding","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"MatomoEncoding","identifier":"doc:\/\/MatomoEncoding\/documentation\/MatomoEncoding"},"doc://Traffluent/documentation/Traffluent/TestingWhatYouTrack":{"role":"article","title":"Testing What Your Code Tracks","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/TestingWhatYouTrack","abstract":[{"text":"Run a test’s body with a fresh tracker and check the events it tracked.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/traffluent\/testingwhatyoutrack","type":"topic","kind":"article"},"doc://HTTPDestinations/documentation/HTTPDestinations":{"abstract":[{"text":"Send each batch of records to an HTTP endpoint, and send it again until it arrives.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/httpdestinations","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"HTTPDestinations","identifier":"doc:\/\/HTTPDestinations\/documentation\/HTTPDestinations"},"doc://Traffluent/documentation/Traffluent/ConsentGating":{"role":"article","title":"Consent Gating","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/traffluent\/consentgating","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/ConsentGating","abstract":[{"text":"Deliver an event only once the user grants the purpose it is collected for.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article"},"doc://Traffluent/documentation/Traffluent/ChoosingDestinations":{"abstract":[{"text":"Deliver events to your logs, your traces, a server or memory, and decide what each destination may see.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","type":"topic","role":"article","title":"Choosing Destinations","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/ChoosingDestinations"},"doc://AutomaticScreenTracking/documentation/AutomaticScreenTracking":{"role":"collection","title":"AutomaticScreenTracking","type":"top